I observed the same behaviour on a PC. It was because the system-clock was set
to a wrong date. Check the system-clock and the gamefiles (both code and data,
I'm not shure of what it looks at) so that they are set to resonable dates. If
not NetHack may believe that your saved game is from an earlier version of NH.

Good luck.

